5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We should be careful about the financial implications of this move. I'll check the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know if the desks are actually comfortable. I'll look into the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm worried about how this affects our daily flow. I'll check the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We need to be honest about the quality of the seats. I'll look into the drawn plan against the staff survey and the arrival times in the badge records.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I want to see how sitting together helps us. I'll check the two project strands within earshot last spring and what this year's two joiners reported.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
